From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 06:02:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add live motion: hero entrance, magnetic CTA, marquee,
 tilt cards

Bring the interactive motion demo into the real site instead of
HyperFrames video rendering, per Emil Kowalski's animation framework
(purposeful, reduced-motion-safe, transform/opacity only):

- Staggered hero entrance on the home page
- Magnetic pull on the primary hero CTA
- A discipline-name marquee strip (max one per page)
- Discipline cards on /clases now show their real photo as a 70%
  opacity background with a gradient scrim for legibility, plus a
  mouse-tracked 3D tilt on hover

All effects collapse to static under prefers-reduced-motion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lnk4T93LH9WLa79FuvsXSG
